{
    "title": "Rising: War for Dominion",
    "description": "Join our Real Time medieval strategy war game.  Train your troops, Build your castle,recruit legendary heroes and join allies in our empire forge game\uff0c\r\n\r\n** Game Features **\r\n[Build Your Castle ]\r\nBuild your empires, upgrade your facilities, research your technologies, train your troops and recruit powerful heroes to strengthen your castle!\r\n\r\n[Explore an Unknown World]\r\nExplore a world shrouded in dense fog, with herds of enemies, abandoned gold mines, and various battlefields, all waiting for your discovery! Build a powerful kingdom through your strategy,find all resources\r\n\r\n[Recruit Legendary Heroes]\r\nRecruit legendary heroes to join your team, start your own age of empire buildings, and upgrade your heroes. They will defend the territory at all costs, lead your army into battles against other enemies, win all battles for the kingdom\u2019s rise, and become the lord of all kings!\r\n\r\n[Defend the Kingdom, Fight for Glory]\r\nThe battle has begun! Now the glorious task of defending the kingdom falls on you! You will experience intense conflicts of civilization. fight for your beliefs!\r\n\r\n\u203b This game is free and contains in-app purchases.\r\n\u203b Follow us for the latest information and rewards:\r\nFacebook\uff1ahttps://facebook.com/risingciv\r\nDiscord\uff1ahttps://discord.gg/q5CVtRkyFX",
